			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400315201,
					"content": "找到小动物后直接交给我就行，我会尽快把它们给送回去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315202,
						400315207,
						400315210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315202,
					"content": "关于「黑影」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400315203,
					"content": "之前也听闻过，某个神秘组织会训练「忍犬」的传言。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315204,
					"content": "据说，有一匹代号「戌壬」的忍犬，在暗中消灭了无数不利于稻妻的魔物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315205,
					"content": "…当然只是传说而已。不过，这个「黑影」，或许就是传说中的忍犬也说不定…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315206,
					"content": "…算了，总感觉像是在给自己找借口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315207,
					"content": "关于「吸引注意力的东西」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400315208,
					"content": "虽然没办法避开它的视线把小动物救出来，但勘察的时候我还是找到机会，部署了一些烟雾机关。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315209,
					"content": "启动机关的话，应该可以暂时吸引它的注意力。希望可以帮上你的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				},
				{
					"id": 400315210,
					"content": "我去去就回。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400315211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400315211,
					"content": "嗯，交给你了。我在这里给你把风。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "龙二"
				}
			]
		}
